extends layout/page

block body
  main
    h1 × Privacy Policy
    p
      a(href="//codin.gg") codin.gg
      | &#32; is committed to protecting your privacy. We believe in data minimization and transparency. We do not use tracking cookies, we do not have a database, and we do not collect your personal data.

    h3 Data Controller
    p For any questions regarding this policy, you can contact the collective at &#32;
      a(href="mailto:dpo@codin.gg") dpo@codin.gg
      | .

    h3 Server Logs
    p Our website is statically hosted on&#32;
      a(href="//pages.github.com") GitHub Pages
      | &#32;(GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. St., San Francisco, CA 94107, USA).
      | When you visit our website, GitHub may automatically collect and store system log files for security and operational purposes (such as your IP address, browser type, and timestamp). This processing is necessary for the legitimate interest of ensuring secure and stable website operations (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).

    h3 Website Analytics
    p We do not use Google Analytics or any privacy-invasive tracking platforms. Any analytics used on this site are strictly anonymous, cookie-less, and do not collect any personally identifiable information (PII).

    //h3 Affiliate Links
    //p Our&#32;
